ina Road Operator For US$280 Mln \par Scotiabank To Buy 19.99% Stake In Bank of Guangzhou For US$727 Mln; Paves Way For Listing \par US Citizens Suspected In Possible 9/11 Terror Plot \par ECB's Stark To Leave Post By End Of Year \par Mexican Finance Minister Quits To Run For Presidency \par Obama Asks Congress For $447B In Tax Cuts, Spending \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 TNK-BP\f28 \uc2 \f2  Corruption Program Leads To 37 Criminal Cases \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Wells Fargo\f28 \uc2 \f2  Weighs Bid For KBC Private Banking Unit \par Greece Rejects Default Talk \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lufthansa\f28 \uc2 \f2  Formally Starts BMI Sale Process -- Source \par NYSE CEO: Crisis Supports Deal With Deutsche Boerse \par  \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 12-09-11 0300GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 62500   \par \par \uc2 Dokument EM00000020110912e79c00004\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
