\par\par \b \uc2 Japan sees G7 "understanding" on  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  action\b0\par\par\uc2 673 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 September 2011\par 09:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Yen issue overshadowed at G7 by worries on euro zone\par \par \uc2 * G7 delegates showed little resistance to Japan action\par \par \uc2 * Less easy for \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to get support for joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 By Tetsushi Kajimoto\par \par \uc2 MARSEILLE, France, Sept 10 (Reuters) - The yen took a back seat at the Group of Seven finance ministers' meeting, which grappled with Europe's debt crisis and global economic slowdown, but \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it met little resistance to further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The G7 economic powers gave a muted reaction to \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's call to endorse its right to unilateral action against speculators pushing up its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but Japanese officials and some analysts said the subdued response suggests the G7 could let \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market again if needed.\par \par \uc2 "We \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in August and I told the (G7) that we will continue to watch the situation closely and flexibly, and take decisive steps against speculative moves," Finance Minister Jun Azumi told a news conference late on Friday after the G7 talks.\par \par \uc2 "No countries voiced opinions against our explanation. I believe we gained understanding towards our view on \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 A senior finance ministry official said the G7 had not ruled out the chance of solo \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In the run-up to the meeting, Japanese officials vowed to seek G7 understanding on Tokyo's intentions to counter yen rises that threaten to derail a recovery from the March earthquake which tipped the world's No. 3 economy into recession.\par \par \uc2 "Japan could not ask for more as it just avoided blunt criticism from other countries against its past \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Masafumi Yamamoto, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 Barclays Capital\uc2  in Tokyo.\par \par \uc2 On Saturday, Azumi told reporters that U.S. Treasury Secretary Timothy Geithner had not voiced opposition in an early morning bilateral meeting.\par \par \uc2 "He was smiling but did not refute. He appears to understand the situation," Azumi said.\par \par \uc2 LITTLE CHANCE OF CONCERTED \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has conducted three \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past year -- one rare co-ordinated action with the G7 shortly after the March 11 disaster and two solo moves.\par \par \uc2 Yamamoto said further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb excess volatility\par \par \uc2 may not meet international opposition as long as it was not done frequently or aimed at guiding \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates towards specific levels as Switzerland did this week by setting an exchange cap on its soaring \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Japan's economy is now recovering from recession, while Europe and the United States face a slowdown, so Tokyo has been having a hard time convincing its G7 counterparts of the need for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jean-Claude Trichet said early last month that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  "have to be made on the basis of a multilateral consensus," signalling displeasure at Japan's solo action on August 4.\par \par \uc2 In Marseille, Japanese officials including Bank of Japan Governor Masaaki Shirakawa blamed the yen's rise on global economic woes that have been amplified by Europe's debt crisis -- the central topic of debate at the G7 talks.\par \par \uc2 "Such an argument may have discouraged Europe from being critical of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have gained a free hand in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," said Takahide Kiuchi, chief economist at Nomura Securities.\par \par \uc2 Japan faces higher hurdles persuading the G7 of the need for a joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is seen as more effective in curbing excess \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, the G7 issued a statement that said exchange rates should be determined by markets and pledged: "We will consult closely in regard to actions in exchange markets and would cooperate as appropriate."\par \par \uc2 "The G7 is not in a situation where it needs to do something about \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it focuses on how to balance public finances while facing slowing economy," said Barclay's Yamamoto.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is reflecting debt problems in the West but it is not causing problems. So G7 must be feeling there's no use dealing with \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to resolve the market situation."\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Catherine Bremer/Mike Peacock)\par \par \uc2 G7/JAPAN-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110913e79a000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
