\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  Aug  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2  4.5 trln yen -MOF\b0\par\par\uc2 316 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 August 2011\par 12:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds details, background)\par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Aug 31 (Reuters) - Japan spent a record 4.5129 trillion yen ($58.8 billion) in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this month, \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed on Wednesday, more than double the previous daily record for its yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Although the amount was in line with market estimates of around 4.46-4.66 trillion yen, it was much bigger than the 2.125 trillion yen of selling on Sept. 16 last year, the previous the daily record.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Aug. 4 boosted the dollar to above 80 yen from around 77 yen, but it quickly lost ground. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a record low of 75.941 yen on Aug. 19 and traded at about 76.56 yen on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 New prime minister Yoshihiko Noda directed the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as finance minister at the time, prompting traders to think \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will remain ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the dollar falls further below the record low.\par \par \uc2 It was a unilateral action, however, unlike in March when Group of Seven (G7) countries conducted their first joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for more than a decade after the yen soared on risk-aversion following Japan's earthquake and tsunami and the subsequent nuclear crisis.\par \par \uc2 The MOF data does not specify which \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were bought and sold or the date on which \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was conducted. But market players said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  took place only on Aug. 4 and only in the dollar/yen.\par \par \uc2 The amount of Japan's yen selling is equal to nearly 1 percent of the Japanese economy, and almost 5 percent of its regular national budget.\par \par \uc2 But many market players think \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has only a limited impact on a market in which roughly $4 trillion changes hands every day.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Hideyuki Sano; Editing by Michael Watson)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 / \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110831e78v000fs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
